  m_Name: help_camera
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_camera
  displayName: Looking around
  order: 110
  category: Basics
  icon: sun
  body: 'Pan with {Pan} or the arrow keys, or hold the middle mouse button and drag. The mouse wheel zooms toward the pointer, in whole steps so the pixel art stays sharp.


    Everything away from your tunnels is dark until your ants dig near it. Breaking into a cave reveals the whole cave at once.


    Point at anything, in the world or on the screen, and the info panel at the bottom says what it is: an ant''s job and health, what a building does and why it waits, what a cell of rock gives when it is dug.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
